# Big ITC'99 sequential circuits (b17-b22, 1.3-14.5 MB each): FETCHED, never committed.
# scripts/fetch_benchmarks.sh installs them here because that is the directory every eval driver
# lists to build its instance set; benchmarks/circuits/README.md carries their provenance.
